{"title": "Intel RealSense T265", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Tracking camera from Intel with two global-shutter fisheye cameras and a Bosch BMI055 IMU, solved here on its own IMU from one recording of our VI-Rig.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Global shutter</span><span class=chip>Stereo fisheye</span><span class=chip>200 Hz IMU</span><span class=chip>CC BY-NC 4.0</span></div>", "glance": "<p>Tracking camera from Intel with two global-shutter fisheye cameras and a Bosch BMI055 IMU, solved here on its own IMU from one recording of our VI-Rig.</p><div class=band><div class=\"demo empty\"><b>No video on this page.</b> The values below come from the solved run.</div><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.21<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>63.8<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−7.99<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>15.0<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>One recording, with no independent reference on this page. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</p>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div>", "map": "<p>Solved positions and orientations, to scale in the IMU frame. Drag sideways to orbit. Tap a sensor for its values.</p><div class=map><div class=stage><canvas id=rig tabindex=0 aria-label=\"3D map of the cameras and IMU\"></canvas><div class=tools><button data-view=iso type=button>3D</button><button data-view=front type=button>Front</button><button data-view=top type=button>Top</button><button data-view=side type=button>Side</button><button data-z=1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button><button data-z=-1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button></div></div><div class=panel><div class=picks id=picks></div><div id=info></div></div></div>", "hardware": "<div class=scroll><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>2 × OV9282, 848×800 at 30 Hz</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>Shutter</td><td>Global</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>Lens</td><td>Fisheye, about 163°</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>IMU</td><td>Bosch BMI055, gyro at 200 Hz, accel at 62.5 Hz</td><td><span class=chip>Measured</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=note>Maker's specs from <a href=\"https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-camera-t265/\">Intel RealSense T265 page</a>, checked 2026-11-03.</p><p class=note>Company: <a href=\"https://www.intelrealsense.com/\">Intel RealSense</a>.</p>", "dataset": "<div class=two><div class=scroll><table><tbody><tr><td>Recording</td><td>VI-Rig, recording 1, 80 s window chosen by motion</td></tr><tr><td>Format</td><td>ROS bag</td></tr><tr><td>Board</td><td>AprilGrid 6×6, tag 88 mm, spacing 0.3, t36h11</td></tr><tr><td>Licence</td><td>CC BY-NC 4.0, for the data and for this page&#x27;s clip and figures; commercial use by request</td></tr><tr><td>Hosted</td><td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/calibench-vi/datasets/tree/main/virig-4imus-3cams/\">Calibench, virig-4imus-3cams/</a> (access on request)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><svg class=board viewBox=\"-13.2 -13.2 686.4 739.2\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AprilGrid layout to scale\"><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"88\" height=\"88\"/><rect x=\"114.40\" y=\"0.00\" wid