2 465.7,54.0 482.1,49.3 498.6,45.0 515.1,41.3 531.5,38.2 548.0,35.6\"/><polyline class=\"c1\" points=\"54.0,220.0 70.5,213.2 86.9,206.4 103.4,199.6 119.9,192.8 136.3,186.0 152.8,179.2 169.3,172.3 185.7,165.5 202.2,158.7 218.7,151.9 235.1,145.0 251.6,138.1 268.1,131.2 284.5,124.3 301.0,117.4 317.5,110.5 333.9,103.7 350.4,96.8 366.9,90.1 383.3,83.5 399.8,77.0 416.3,70.7 432.7,64.7 449.2,59.0 465.7,53.6 482.1,48.6 498.6,44.0 515.1,39.8 531.5,35.9 548.0,32.3\"/></svg></div></div><p class=legend><i class=c0></i>cam0 <i class=c1></i>cam1 </p><p class=note>Past a curve's turn the fit can't describe the lens, so those edges have no figure.</p>", "imu": "<div class=v data-v=\"0\"><p>Scale as deviation from 1. Model: calyx. Gyro-to-accel time offset <code>t_ga</code>: −6.59 ± 0.43 ms.</p><div class=bars><div class=bar><span>Gyro scale x</span><i><u style=\"left:47.20%;width:2.80%\"></u></i><b>−0.45 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Gyro scale y</span><i><u style=\"left:48.21%;width:1.79%\"></u></i><b>−0.29 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Gyro scale z</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:3.01%\"></u></i><b>+0.48 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale x</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:13.02%\"></u></i><b>+2.08 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale y</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:13.61%\"></u></i><b>+2.18 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale z</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:8.16%\"></u></i><b>+1.31 %</b></div><div class=bar><span></span><em><s>−8 %</s><s>0</s><s>+8 %</s></em><b></b></div></div></div>", "timing": "<p>Offsets to scale, with t_imu = t_cam + td.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=chart><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 136\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Time offsets in milliseconds, to scale\"><line class=\"g\" x1=70.0 x2=70.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=70.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-20 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=177.5 x2=177.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=177.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-10 ms</text><line class=\"g z\" x1=285.0 x2=285.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=285.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+0 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=392.5 x2=392.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=392.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+10 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=500.0 x2=500.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=500.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+20 ms</text><text x=0 y=22>cam0 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=199.1 y1=18 y2=18 /><circle class=dot cx=199.1 cy=18 r=5 /><text x=190.1 y=22 text-anchor=end>−7.99</text><text x=0 y=56>cam1 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=170.5 y1=52 y2=52 /><circle class=dot cx=170.5 cy=52 r=5 /><text x=161.5 y=56 text-anchor=end>−10.65</text><text x=0 y=90>t_ga</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=214.1 y1=86 y2=86 /><circle class=dot cx=214.1 cy=86 r=5 /><text x=205.1 y=90 text-anchor=end>−6.59</text></svg></div></div>", "results": "<p>Rotation is log(R) in rad, camera in the IMU frame.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=scroll><table class=num><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>MVIS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>cam0</th></tr><tr><td>fx px</td><td>286.44</td></tr><tr><td>fy px</td><td>285.86</td></tr><tr><td>cx px</td><td>415.36</td></tr><tr><td>cy px</td><td>403.21</td></tr><tr><td>k1</td><td>−0.00258</td></tr><tr><td>k2</td><td>0.03660</td></tr><tr><td>k3</td><td>−0.03556</td></tr><tr><td>k4</td><td>0.00595</td></tr><tr><td>Lever x mm</td><td>+11.69</td></tr><tr><td>Lever y mm</td><td>+4.33</td></tr><tr><td>Lever z mm</td><td>+8.41</td></tr><tr><td>log(R) rad</td><td>[+0.0173, −0.0003, −3.1271]</td></tr><tr><td>td ms</td><td>−7.992</td></tr><tr><td>Reprojection px</td><td>0.415</td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>cam1</th></tr><tr><td>fx px</td><td>286.30</td></tr><tr><td>fy px</td><td>285.56</td></tr><tr><td>cx px</td><td>414.91</td></tr><tr><td>cy px</td><td>397.49</td></tr><tr><td>k1</td><td>−0.00356</td></tr><tr><td>k2</td><td>0.03876</td></tr><tr><td>k3</td><td>−0.03782</td></tr><tr><td>k4</td><td>0.00702</td></tr><tr><td>Lever x mm</td><td>−52.15</td></tr><tr><td>Lever y mm</td><td>+4.07</td></tr><tr><td>Lever z mm</td><td>+7.52</td></tr><tr><td>log(R) rad</td><td>[+0.0268, −0.0045, −3.1260]</td></tr><tr><td>td ms</td><td>−10.649</td></tr><tr><td>Reprojection px</td><td>0.406</td></tr><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>IMU</th></tr><tr><td>t_ga ms</td><td>−6.59 ± 0.43</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>", "limits": "<ul class=list><li>One recording, with no independent reference on this page. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</li><li>The T265 gyro-to-accel offset isn&#x27;t a pure time shift. We measured about −6.8 ms at 2–4 Hz and −1.2 ms at 30–40 Hz, so a single t_ga is a compromise that depends on the motion.</li></ul>", "run": "<ul class=list><li>Fisheye stereo plus the T265&#x27;s own IMU, camera intrinsics free, t_ga on. Batch of 2026-11-03.</li></ul>", "header": "<div class=sd><div class=sd-grid><div class=sd-head><a class=sd-maker href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/192742/intel-realsense-tracking-camera-t265/specifications.html\">Intel RealSense ↗︎</a><h1 id=\"_top\">Intel RealSense T265</h1><p class=sd-type>Tracking camera: global-shutter fisheye stereo with a Bosch BMI055 IMU</p></div><figure class=sd-plate><div class=sd-frame><img src=\"/media/sensors/intel-t265/intel-t265.jpg\" alt=\"Intel RealSense T265, front view\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></div><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.intc.com/news-events/press-releases/detail/97/intel-announces-new-class-of-realsense-stand-alone\">Photo: Intel, T265 launch press release ↗︎</a></figcaption></figure><div class=sd-cta><div class=sd-buttons><a class=\"sd-btn primary\" href=\"https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/192742/intel-realsense-tracking-camera-t265/specifications.html\">Intel specifications ↗︎</a><a class=sd-btn href=\"#specifications\">All specs (4) ↓</a></div></div><div class=sd-specs><dl class=sd-rows><div class=sd-row><dt>Cameras</dt><dd>848 × 800 fisheye stereo<a class=sd-tag href=\"https://www.intel.com/cont